# Backend Standards

- Use `src/config/app.config.ts` for branding and config values with fallbacks
- Never hardcode secrets, URLs, or app names in source code
- One module per domain under `src/<module>/`
- DTOs must use `class-validator` and Swagger `@ApiProperty` decorators
- Error messages must use i18n keys (`api.errors.*`, `api.user.*`)
- Pagination via `PaginationHelper` and `nestjs-typeorm-paginate`
- Protected routes use `AuthGuard('jwt')` + `RolesGuard` + `@RolesDecorator`
- Authenticated user via the `@User()` decorator
- Enums live in `src/enums/`
- Feature flags via `FeatureFlagsService.isEnabled()`
